1. Flash Offer Banner (conditional)
2. Navigation Bar
3. Hero / Introduction
4. Trust & Credibility
5. How It Works
6. Testimonials
7. Pass Guarantee
8. Premium Value / Pricing CTA
9. FAQ
10. Footer

